Package: qore-geos-module
Architecture: any
Depends: ${qore:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: qore-geos-module-doc
Description: geometry operations and spatial data providers for Qore
 This package provides the GEOS native module and GEOSDataProvider for
 geometry predicates, topology operations, spatial indexing and WKT, WKB
 and GeoJSON data processing. It includes source and compiled Qore modules,
 compiler metadata, provider resources and translations.

Package: qore-geos-module-doc
Section: doc
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Build-Profiles: <!nodoc>
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: qore-geos-module
Description: documentation and examples for Qore's GEOS modules
 This package contains HTML API references and example tests for the geos
 native module and GEOSDataProvider.
